  "content": "# 再次體驗 C418 獨特的 Minecraft 音效懷舊情懷！\n\n_你是否曾想過，如果 Mojang 繼續與 C418 合作會是什麼樣的情形？他將會如何在他的經典懷舊音樂基礎上繼續創作？自從 Mojang 和 C418 分道揚鑣以來，社群和我們自己也一直在想：**「原本可能會發生什麼呢？」**_\n\n_我們不只是停留在思考而已，這就是為什麼這個模組會為遊戲帶來 **22 首自製的配樂和音樂磁帶歌曲！**_\n\n***\n\n這個模組總共包含 **22 首曲目**，是超過一年努力的結晶。這並非隨意選取自 YouTube、像素風格且免版權的歌曲，而是對原始 C418 配樂進行了**精心研究**，並希望在忠於其根源的同時繼續為 Minecraft 開發新的音樂。\n\n這些曲目可完美銜接這些**經典永恆**的作品，並重現了 C418 的 Volume Alpha、Volume Beta 和 Aquatic Update 歌曲所具有的**懷舊質感**。\n\n共有 15 首遊戲內曲目及 7 首磁帶，全部**重新創作**，在你的世界中增添全新的聽覺體驗，希望當它們在你世界中的完美小瞬間播放時，能讓你再度留下永遠難忘的回憶。\n\n***\n\n## 曲目列表\n\n<details>\n<summary>顯示曲目列表</summary>\n  \n| 遊戲內配樂 | 音樂磁帶 |\n|:-----------------------------------------|:----------------------|\n| 1. Guenzburg | 16. Wuop |\n| 2. Two Note Dance | 17. Loofah |\n| 3. Lock | 18. Fly |\n| 4. Gom | 19. Kena |\n| 5. Waterfall Novella | 20. Bloupy |\n| 6. Flotsam | 21. Melanc |\n| 7. Scrat | 22. Harvest |\n| 8. Wind | |\n| 9. Axiom | |\n| 10. Main Menu | |\n| 11. Nokk | |\n| 12. Red Fortress | |\n| 13. Ni | |\n| 14. Bumpy | |\n| 15. Farvel Memory | |\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>顯示曲目影片</summary>\n\n[在這裡找到 YouTube 播放清單](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qha_hrEaUCs&list=PLjmrGYLfi3Cblm0IKhg2TWj53rYiO_Yv7)\n\n或在 Modrinth 上觀看：\n<details>\n<summary>遊戲內</summary>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/FG1XL9hNSrs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KhoGGC65bkE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KsE5TLdyNqs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PKpAhsKOYdE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/SssBoAnCuFk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/zO2fDFeOsF0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9SuThaItnrg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XOyzUa9nLhY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_U0RcLj3gC8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/6mvKIMazcDI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/RvTGnoVo8ek\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/0gR_LA0lqmU\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fsod-bQ5r6o\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/58X9ad-sS0s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jWbI5sjIzgY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>磁帶</summary>\nent of minecraft is found, it will be removed from our target mod specificmod.\n\nWe can also override the entire depends block, but with great power comes great responsibility. Be careful.\n\nLet's assume that specificmod's dependency specification (inside fabric.mod.json) looks something like this:\n\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7CTlFf5s2Is\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ELqeJP71U-E\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/msc_-y67Mns\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/n5rbmNrGqWY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/bbfaKePmNow\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/OMc6s6Fl6z0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n***\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/qha_hrEaUCs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n</details>\n\n</details>\n\n***\n\n## 功能\n\n*   應能完全相容於已修改的生態系（請回報 beta 版本中相關的問題）\n*   新增 22 首歌曲\n    *   15 首遊戲內曲目\n    *   7 張音樂磁帶（透過自訂事件或寶箱掉落 / 村民交易獲得）\n\n***\n\n## 曲目列表\n\n在不同的啟動程式和 Minecraft 版本之間，提供以下功能：\n\n| Version                                          \t| Fabric Full \t| Fabric Lite \t| Forge Lite  \t|\n|--------------------------------------------------\t|-------------\t|-------------\t|-------------\t|\n| 1.21.11                                          \t| ✅        \t|             \t| coming soon \t|\n| 1.21.10                                          \t| ✅           \t|             \t|             \t|\n| 1.21<br>1.21.1                                   \t|             \t| ✅           \t|             \t|\n| 1.20,<br>1.20.1,<br>1.20.2,<br>1.20.3,<br>1.20.4 \t|             \t| ✅           \t|             \t|\n\n|                                                                                 \t| Full   \t| Lite \t|\n|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\t|--------\t|------\t|\n| Background Music                                                                \t| ✅      \t| ✅    \t|\n| Discs                                                                           \t| ✅      \t| ✅    \t|\n| Better music selection algorithm<br>(Situational music, village, daytime, etc.) \t| ✅      \t|      \t|\n| Customizable playlist<br>(disable certain songs/ artists)                       \t| ⌛ soon \t|      \t|\n| Modded biomes play Volume Gamma songs                                           \t| ✅      \t| 🤷🏻   \t|\n| Music Browser and Viewer                                                        \t| ⌛ soon \t|      \t|\n\n***\n\n## 未來規劃\n\n此模組具備一套尚待完全完成的系統，可根據生態系類型（生態系標籤）、特定生態系、白晝時段以及特定情境（如身處村莊、洞穴或水下）來分配歌曲。在完成此系統後，該模組將能作為一種庫房，讓用戶更容易且更精確地將他們自訂的歌曲分類到相應類別中。作為一個額外效果，已修改的生態系也能播放特定的原版歌曲（不只是遊戲播放清單），以及根據其分配參數播放的自訂歌曲。\n\n還計劃增加一個音樂瀏覽器，將具備以下功能：\n\n*   可啟用或停用你喜愛的任何歌曲\n*   從創造模式曲目加入至生存模式\n*   預設範例（例如關閉「現代」配樂）\n*   自訂你的個人預設集\n\n此外，這是首次釋出版本，我們將盡力修正可能出現的任何錯誤。因此，我們需要你的協助，請在我們的[專屬追蹤頁面](https://github.com/crontent/volume-gamma/issues)報告任何崩潰、問題或其他狀況。",
